flowchart LR
    C --> B[Exact uncollided-beam integration]
    B --> W
    C[Validated configuration<br/>geometry · source · synthetic MG data] --> O[Independent OpenMC solver]
    O --> T[Volume-normalized mesh tallies<br/>mean + standard error + seeds]
    T --> D[Geometry-level partitions<br/>pool / calibration / test / OOD]
    D --> L[Low-history pool<br/>POD basis + kernel field]
    D --> H[Selected high-history labels]
    L --> N[Trained residual MLP ensemble]
    H --> N
    N --> A[Uncertainty-driven acquisition]
    A --> H
    N --> Q[Reserved-geometry calibration]
    D --> Q
    Q --> V[Independent held-out comparisons<br/>baselines · coverage · cost]
    V --> W[Hybrid field sum + observatory + exports]
    Q --> P[Numeric NPZ model weights]
    P --> W
